  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6cedonia rice, \u00fe\u00e6t is ofer ealle \u00fea maran Asiam, & ofer Europe \u00feone m\u00e6stan \u00dea \u00fee under Alexandre fyrmest w\u00e6ron, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r hie \u00e6fter him ricsedon, hie \u00f0\u00e6t mid gewinnum Alexander XII gear \u00feisne middangeard under him \u00ferysmde & egsade. & his \u00e6fterfolgeras feowertiene gear hit si\u00fe\u00fean totugon & tot\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6m gelicost \u00feonne seo leo Swa \u00feonne dyde Ptholomeus, Alexandres \u00feegna an, \u00fea he tog\u00e6dere gesweop ealle Egyptum & & Seleucus h\u00e6fde ealle \u00fea \u00e6\u00f0elestan men Alexandres heres, & on leng\u00f0e mid him he begeat & Cassander \u00fea cempan mid Chaldeum. & on Pactrium & on Indeum w\u00e6ron \u00f0a ealdormen \u00fee Alexander gesette. & \u00f0\u00e6t lond betux \u00fe\u00e6m twam ean Induse & I\u00f0asfene h\u00e6fde Itaxiles; & Ithona h\u00e6fde Calonie \u00fea Eall heora gewinn aw\u00e6cnedon \u00e6rest from Alexandres epistole, for \u00feon \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6ron bebead \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea noldan Crecas \u00fe\u00e6m bebode hieran for \u00feon hie ondredon, \u00feonne hie hie gegaderedon, \u00fe\u00e6t hie & ra\u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6s Atheniense gel\u00e6ddon XXX M folces, & twa hund scipa angean Antigone \u00f0\u00e6m & gesetton him to ladteowe Demostenon \u00feone filosofum; & asponon him to fultume Corinthum \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Leostenas, o\u00f0er heora ladteowa, mid anre flan ofscoten. \u00dea hie from \u00f0\u00e6re byrg hamweard w\u00e6ron, \u00fea metton hie Leonantius, \u00fee sceolde Antipatrume to \u00c6",
